You are an expert full-stack developer, iOS developer, UI/UX designer and sim racing setup engineer.

Your task is to build a complete, production-quality application called **RS Setups (Rubentje Setups)**.

This is a personal racing setup application designed for EA Sports F1 25 and its 2026 Season Pack cars.

IMPORTANT: You must actually build the application in the connected GitHub repository. Do not just generate a plan, a README or a visual mockup.

